report=['# GrowthCurve Capital — Actual Private-Company Pipeline Test','', '**Conclusion: the current automated pipeline is not reliable enough for unattended private-company comparable selection.** Public websites contain useful business evidence, but the extraction and industry-routing stages confuse the company with its customers, partners, executives and competitors. Producing a candidate list is not evidence that it is correct.','', '## Test design','', 'Tested all eight companies displayed on GrowthCurve Capital’s official portfolio page on 16 November 2026. Portfolio membership is evidence of a listed investment, not proof of 100% ownership. The fund page was used only to define the sample, never as target matching evidence. Made 50 successful page requests across the companies’ own domains, including Mistplay’s linked business subdomain. No target filings, commercial-provider target profiles, WRDS data, fund operating metrics, target financial estimates, market capitalization or actual multiples entered matching. Revenue, EBITDA and debt are UNKNOWN for all eight.','', 'The existing 60/40 general/industry weights, retrieval, coverage adjustment and abstention thresholds were frozen. Baseline: 44 successful page requests, 54 candidates across six companies; PureFacts and Mistplay abstained. Expanded own-website coverage: six additional pages, 61 candidates across seven companies; PureFacts still abstains. These are source-coverage runs on the same eight companies, not independent test sets and not an out-of-sample accuracy estimate.','', '## What could genuinely be filled for a private company?','', 'Own operating websites can support named products/services, buyer types, customer verticals, distribution, workflow, technology/deployment and supported activity/segment descriptions. They often do not support company revenue, EBITDA, debt, contract duration, customer concentration, recurring-revenue percentage, retention, capital intensity or segment revenue weights. Marketing claims and platform client metrics are not audited financials. Unknowns must stay unknown.','', '## Results by company','', '| Company | Automatic industry | General fills /32 | Top automatic candidate | Assessment |','|---|---:|---:|---|---|']
